      "message": "Not sure what you mean here? And how this fits in the wider context of supporting JJ change-id headers.\n\nThe community discussed an approach to supporting JJ headers at [1], but don\u0027t believe this was part of it. Could you expand on how this fits within that view?\n\nIf it helps, I created a series of experimental changes to see what work would be needed to support this at [2], feel free to use them as inspiration.\n\n[1] https://www.gerritcodereview.com/design-docs/support-jujutsu-solution.html\n[2] https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit/+/555301",
